			"updated": 1783684440767,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Unordered (Unsorted) Collections:\n    - Items are stored randomly with no specific sequence.\n    - Impact: You have no shortcuts. You must check items one by one until you \n      find what you are looking for (or exhaust the entire collection).\n- Ordered (Sorted) Collections:\n    - Items are arranged in a specific sequence (e.g., Ascending or Descending \n      order).\n    - Impact: This allows for much smarter, faster searching strategies (like \n      skipping half the collection at a time) because you know exactly where an \n      item  should  be relative to other items.",
			"rawText": "- Unordered (Unsorted) Collections:\n    - Items are stored randomly with no specific sequence.\n    - Impact: You have no shortcuts. You must check items one by one until you \n      find what you are looking for (or exhaust the entire collection).\n- Ordered (Sorted) Collections:\n    - Items are arranged in a specific sequence (e.g., Ascending or Descending \n      order).\n    - Impact: This allows for much smarter, faster searching strategies (like \n      skipping half the collection at a time) because you know exactly where an \n      item  should  be relative to other items.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "iDM0l8WbKx9HE9Pfe3jNC",
			"originalText": "- Unordered (Unsorted) Collections:\n    - Items are stored randomly with no specific sequence.\n    - Impact: You have no shortcuts. You must check items one by one until you \n      find what you are looking for (or exhaust the entire collection).\n- Ordered (Sorted) Collections:\n    - Items are arranged in a specific sequence (e.g., Ascending or Descending \n      order).\n    - Impact: This allows for much smarter, faster searching strategies (like \n      skipping half the collection at a time) because you know exactly where an \n      item  should  be relative to other items.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
