			"versionNonce": 2052500450,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1783684440767,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Iterable<T> (Root): Anything that can be looped over.\n- Collection<E> (Core Interface): The root of most collections. \n    Extended by:\n        - List<E>: Ordered, allows duplicates (ArrayList, LinkedList).\n        - Set<E>: Unordered, no duplicates (HashSet, TreeSet).\n        - Queue<E>: FIFO processing (PriorityQueue, ArrayDeque).\n- Map<K,V> (Separate branch): Key-Value pairs (HashMap, TreeMap). ",
			"rawText": "- Iterable<T> (Root): Anything that can be looped over.\n- Collection<E> (Core Interface): The root of most collections. \n    Extended by:\n        - List<E>: Ordered, allows duplicates (ArrayList, LinkedList).\n        - Set<E>: Unordered, no duplicates (HashSet, TreeSet).\n        - Queue<E>: FIFO processing (PriorityQueue, ArrayDeque).\n- Map<K,V> (Separate branch): Key-Value pairs (HashMap, TreeMap). ",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "6jSYp2ZxKuPLRy4T_S65N",
			"originalText": "- Iterable<T> (Root): Anything that can be looped over.\n- Collection<E> (Core Interface): The root of most collections. \n    Extended by:\n        - List<E>: Ordered, allows duplicates (ArrayList, LinkedList).\n        - Set<E>: Unordered, no duplicates (HashSet, TreeSet).\n        - Queue<E>: FIFO processing (PriorityQueue, ArrayDeque).\n- Map<K,V> (Separate branch): Key-Value pairs (HashMap, TreeMap). ",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
